{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":990337,\"title\":\"Diary of a Spy\",\"tagline\":\"Love is not a real thing\",\"overview\":\"Anna is a washed-up intelligence officer whose last mission left 7 people dead. Drunk, broke, and alone she is given the chance for one last mission: to seduce and recruit a valuable asset connected to the Saudi Royal Family. As she gets closer and closer to her target, Anna finds she is in over her head and she must decide between accomplishing her mission or finding a way to save herself.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1Edo6T4MQRxlH5IeQalb1UTSYUb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vHDYDknnjIbuP0Poy0EJurtgjQs.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"voteCount\":9,\"year\":2022,\"runtime\":99,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Adam Christian Clark\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1167211,\"name\":\"Adam Christian Clark\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pZFa7agia0Zdg4KfNIltQSUI6rD.jpg\"},{\"id\":39464,\"name\":\"Tamara Taylor\",\"character\":\"Anna\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4hvMoHSki7mZUPxcJXysLEw5Z5I.jpg\"},{\"id\":1232744,\"name\":\"Reece Noi\",\"character\":\"Camden\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4n7zlMmSagTpBuZle0AIV07xnCr.jpg\"},{\"id\":105303,\"name\":\"Fred Melamed\",\"character\":\"James\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cb5HSNuu6n4OVuxxQCDd5CfEocb.jpg\"},{\"id\":1222969,\"name\":\"Jon Lindstrom\",\"character\":\"George\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tofGx1IJEqsGpakqLnhSjE31nL0.jpg\"},{\"id\":543204,\"name\":\"Susan Sullivan\",\"character\":\"S\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cafgP4eWAKCwPP76qO7xSkbrSUz.jpg\"},{\"id\":1687919,\"name\":\"Paulina Leija\",\"character\":\"Fahda\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1757698,\"name\":\"Haithem Badrani\",\"character\":\"Mousa\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4cVJNuJ2R5lrxmAooYjW32JWSjL.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1596275,\"title\":\"Drive - The Pretenders\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s9syckECnUYhKePQ1A0DC0mFVZ9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hbz4aeVsjnKb2HRoFbbr46Egh8y.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young mechanic fakes an engagement with racing's most scandalous star — officially for his reputation, secretly for her own shot behind the wheel. But soon the lie threatens to destroy everything — including what's already become so much more than just a deal.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":290098,\"title\":\"The Handmaiden\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dLlH4aNHdnmf62umnInL8xPlPzw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2b3RNXF7ca9bgX8FrjRBYfLnNQC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"1930s Korea, in the period of Japanese occupation, a new girl, Sook-hee, is hired as a handmaiden to a Japanese heiress, Hideko, who lives a secluded life on a large countryside estate with her domineering Uncle Kouzuki. But the maid has a secret. She is a pickpocket recruited by a swindler posing as a Japanese Count to help him seduce the Lady to steal her fortune.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1010581,\"title\":\"My Fault\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w46Vw536HwNnEzOa7J24YH9DPRS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oz4U9eA6ilYf1tyiVuGmkftdLac.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Noah must leave her city, boyfriend, and friends to move into William Leister's mansion, the flashy and wealthy husband of her mother Rafaela. As a proud and independent 17 year old, Noah resists living in a mansion surrounded by luxury. However, it is there where she meets Nick, her new stepbrother, and the clash of their strong personalities becomes evident from the very beginning.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":216015,\"title\":\"Fifty Shades of Grey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/63kGofUkt1Mx0SIL4XI4Z5AoSgt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7IGKrY1f1KfwMipx9wZC4NRgIdF.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When college senior Anastasia Steele steps in for her sick roommate to interview prominent businessman Christian Grey for their campus paper, little does she realize the path her life will take. Christian, as enigmatic as he is rich and powerful, finds himself strangely drawn to Ana, and she to him. Though sexually inexperienced, Ana plunges headlong into an affair -- and learns that Christian's true sexual proclivities push the boundaries of pain and pleasure.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":950396,\"title\":\"The Gorge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7iMBZzVZtG0oBug4TfqDb9ZxAOa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9nhjGaFLKtddDPtPaX5EmKqsWdH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two highly trained operatives grow close from a distance after being sent to guard opposite sides of a mysterious gorge. When an evil below emerges, they must work together to survive what lies within.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1440098,\"title\":\"Drawn Together\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rpvddXbaQPOi0fB2HKWbZ3uUSg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i65y7cMae36K0giN0GRaMjAHUru.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Marfil, daughter of a powerful Spanish businessman, sees her life in New York turned upside down when she is kidnapped and released without explanation. Her father hires Sebastian Moore as bodyguard and, forced to spend every minute together, an inevitable attraction ignites in a world where nothing is as it seems.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4588,\"title\":\"Lust, Caution\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6c1tqfJEBuIyhQC19SLlLQAUAvJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lU1fQews2gye23PocVE48CsTmOQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During World War II, a secret agent must seduce, then assassinate an official  who works for the Japanese puppet government in Shanghai. Her mission becomes clouded when she finds herself falling in love with the man she is assigned to kill.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2251,\"title\":\"Unfaithful\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k8qn3o8AomSJd91HPpxQrw1KYN3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/egVj5Y9f79xPnyAQJmeDR0Uwow3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A New York suburban couple's marriage goes dangerously awry when the wife indulges in an adulterous fling.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":705996,\"title\":\"Decision to Leave\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zI8KZ4EdLUymWKX1YEkpZ0gtPUa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y7efrL5RlIRsGfrhcaiP35V1x2g.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From a mountain peak in South Korea, a man plummets to his death. Did he jump, or was he pushed? When detective Hae-joon arrives on the scene, he begins to suspect the dead man’s wife Seo-rae. But as he digs deeper into the investigation, he finds himself trapped in a web of deception and desire.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1097549,\"title\":\"Babygirl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ilwO6elz3mLV9CToT7C8pjVeKX0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s7vWRjcfRVMW8tBIx